    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853460/extras/3de995cc0c7a700d98139b4662ba0b4a.avif?t=1734789781\" width=630 height=126 /></span><br>Pollie a.k.a Unneeded Robotic Organism. In a world ravaged by an apocalyptic catastrophe, where once-thriving cities had fallen into ruins, a lonely robot named Pollie found itself all alone. With a friendly appearance and expressive eyes, Pollie wandered through the desolate landscapes, wondering where all the people had gone. It was on a quest to discover if there was any hope left for humanity.<br><br>Pollie: Tales of an Unneeded Robotic Organism is a 2D RPG-platform game. During your adventure, you must help a cowardly but emotional robot who questioning the world and system he lives in and fight against evil forces.",
